{
 "source": "geneva",
 "book": "1SA",
 "chapter": 12,
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.12.1",
   "range": "1SA.12.1",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "be82d8b7",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.12.1#p1-be82d8b7",
     "text": "I have granted your petition.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "hearkened unto your voice in all"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.12.2",
   "range": "1SA.12.2",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "1442a6e7",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.12.2#p1-1442a6e7",
     "text": "To govern you in peace and war.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "before you"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.12.3",
   "range": "1SA.12.3",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "eb5ed1af",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.12.3#p1-eb5ed1af",
     "text": "God would have this confession be a pattern for all who have any charge or office.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "whose ox have I taken"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.12.5",
   "range": "1SA.12.5",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "56952570",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.12.5#p1-56952570",
     "text": "Your King, who is anointed by the commandment of the Lord.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "anointed is witness this day"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.12.9",
   "range": "1SA.12.9",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "8f4f1665",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.12.9#p1-8f4f1665",
     "text": "Captain of Jabin's host, king of Hazor.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "captain of the host of Hazor"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.12.11",
   "range": "1SA.12.11",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "241fd1c9",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.12.11#p1-241fd1c9",
     "text": "That is Samson, Jud 13:25.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "and Bedan",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Jud 13:25",
       "ref": "JDG.13.25"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.12.12",
   "range": "1SA.12.12",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "53888070",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.12.12#p1-53888070",
     "text": "Leaving God to seek the help of man, 1Sa 8:5.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "Nay",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Sa 8:5",
       "ref": "1SA.8.5"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.12.14",
   "range": "1SA.12.14",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "afe87515",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.12.14#p1-afe87515",
     "text": "You shall be preserved as they that follow the Lord's will.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "following the LORD your God"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.12.15",
   "range": "1SA.12.15",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "dcf65565",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.12.15#p1-dcf65565",
     "text": "Meaning, the governors.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "fathers"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.12.17",
   "range": "1SA.12.17",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "33a6f0f1",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.12.17#p1-33a6f0f1",
     "text": "In that you have forsaken him, who has all power in his hand, for a mortal man.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "great"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.12.19",
   "range": "1SA.12.19",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "80855a4f",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.12.19#p1-80855a4f",
     "text": "Not only at other times, but now chiefly.",
     "label": "l",
     "anchor": "all our sins this evil"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.12.20",
   "range": "1SA.12.20",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "b9934020",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.12.20#p1-b9934020",
     "text": "He shows that there is no sin so great, but it shall be forgiven, if the sinner turn again to God.",
     "label": "m",
     "anchor": "yet turn not aside from following"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.12.22",
   "range": "1SA.12.22",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "1e12ec3f",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.12.22#p1-1e12ec3f",
     "text": "Of his free mercy, and not of your merits, and therefore he will not forsake you.",
     "label": "n",
     "anchor": "his people"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.12.24",
   "range": "1SA.12.24",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "ef6feade",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.12.24#p1-ef6feade",
     "text": "Unfeignedly, and without hypocrisy.",
     "label": "o",
     "anchor": "heart"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
